    "text": "The 2014 Korean qualifiers for the Pokémon World Championships began with qualifying rounds in April 2014, where every card game entrant received Team Flare Grunt 003/XY-P. The card game final was held on 5 July 2014 at Lotte Department Store Yeongdeungpo, where the top players received Victory Ring cards 004 to 006/XY-P."
